sequenceDiagram
    participant SC as System Canvas (android.graphics.Canvas)
    participant ACV as AndroidComposeView
    participant CH as CanvasHolder
    participant AC as AndroidCanvas Wrapper
    participant Root as Compose LayoutNode Tree

    SC->>ACV: dispatchDraw(systemCanvas)
    ACV->>CH: drawInto(systemCanvas)
    CH->>AC: 暫時將 internalCanvas 指向 systemCanvas
    CH->>Root: root.draw(androidCanvas)
    Root->>AC: 執行繪圖指令 (drawRect, drawText...)
    AC->>SC: 直接委派給 systemCanvas 執行
    CH->>AC: 繪製結束，恢復 internalCanvas
